#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Álki TypeScript aplikáša (via Vite) čeggejuvvon\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"ja adnideame\n"
"čeakcu-freedjalaš meaddil elemeantat\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Ovdanbuktit\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Mii lea dás\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` bivtti `@pantoken/css` (definiira buohkka `--instui-*` "
"meaddil geažes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` klassat),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (čohkkida modal, tooltip, ja eará komponeantta "
"dárbbalusa\n"
"  njealji), ja `@pantoken/web-components` (automáhtalaš registrere "
"elemeantat ovdamearkkadussan `<instui-icon>`), jođa raadja markup\n"
"  `#app`.\n"
"- Valljejuvvon sievvan ođas (bealje, sieđut, sisdoallu, maŋŋebealji) lea "
"merkejuvvon\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — jorgalan dan sisdoallu diidon ohppi markup.\n"
"- Adnide meaddil elemeantat njealji markup, ovdamearkkadussan `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  oaidnit [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  maŋŋebealji element listi.\n"
"\n"
"## Oahpahit eanet\n"
"\n"
"Oaidnit [HTML čeakcu](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) oahpahit "
"eanet.\n"
